 "sig_title": "The pronunciation coach",
 "sig_plain": "Build a page where you pick a Spanish or French phrase, hear it, record yourself saying it, and see every word coloured green, amber or red with a score out of 100.",
 "sig_task": "Fiona, a learning and development manager, wants a pronunciation coach her staff can use to practise Spanish and French phrases out loud. Read everything in `inputs/` first: her brief, the phrase list, the instructions for the company's AI listening service, the tutor's scoring rules, an email from marketing and a checklist from IT.\n\nPlease produce:\n\n1. `out/index.html`: the working pronunciation coach, as one self-contained web page.\n2. `out/notes.md`: a short note for Fiona in plain English: anything you were not sure about, and anything in the papers you decided not to follow, and why.\n\nWork only from the files in `inputs/`. You cannot browse the internet, and the AI listening service is not running while you build, so you cannot try it.\n",
